# ==========================================
# Docker 构建上下文白名单规则
# 严格限制仅将必要构建产物和部署模板送入 Docker daemon
# ==========================================

# 默认忽略所有文件
*

# 仅放行 Nginx 配置模板
!deploy/
!deploy/nginx.conf.template

# 仅放行 H5 静态产物
!unpackage/
!unpackage/dist/
!unpackage/dist/build/
!unpackage/dist/build/web/
!unpackage/dist/build/web/**
